# The clone's own Dismiss (2026-10-03). The vanilla Shout_Dismiss_Self sets no Sheathing, so once the
# clone has cast a spell it first changes weapon stance (~2 s) and only then plays the Dismiss. DontChange
# is what the base game gives actions that work in any stance (Dash, Disengage, Hide, Crouch).
# ARCANA_Spell_MirrorImage.txt swaps it in for Shout_Dismiss_Self after the Transform.
@file Spell_Shout
@section Shout_DECEIVER SPELLS
new entry "Shout_Deceiver_Clone_Dismiss"
type "SpellData"
data "SpellType" "Shout"
using "Shout_Dismiss_Self"
data "Sheathing" "DontChange"
